A '''Tusken Raider camp'''<ref name="Chapter 1 guide">{{SW|url=series/the-book-of-boba-fett/chapter-1-stranger-in-a-strange-land-episode-guide|text="Stranger in a Strange Land" Chapter 1 Episode Guide &#124; The Book of Boba Fett}}</ref> was located in the [[Dune Sea]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[planet]] [[Tatooine]] in the last [[Standard day|days]] of the [[Galactic Empire]]. It was [[Massacre of a Tusken Raider tribe|destroyed]] by the [[Pyke Syndicate]], who put false evidence pointing to the [[Kintan Striders Gang]].<ref name="Name of Honor" />

==Description==
This camp was the home of a [[Unidentified Tusken Raider tribe|tribe]] of [[Tusken Raider]]s on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[planet]] [[Tatooine]]. The camp was located in the [[Dune Sea]]. It contained several tents that served as the dwellings of the Tusken group.<ref name="Chapter 1" />

